sp.p:
   Most sweet Hercules! More authority,dear boy, name more;
and, sweet my child, let them be men of good repute and
carriage.

   No egma, no riddle, no l'envoy; no salve in the mail, sir:
O, sir, plantain, a plain plantain! no l'envoy; no l'envoy;
no salve, sir, but a plantain!

   Shall I have audience? he shall present Hercules in
minority: his enter and exit shall be strangling a snake;
and I will have an apology for that purpose.
